{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940880/extras/40884aecfef55f024e8171fc12edd579.avif?t=1757978216\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardamom is a visual novel set inside of a musical. You play as a stray cat investigating their new surroundings and potentially befriending a new owner. Explore and meet the human (and non human) residents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played with mouse and key board. You are able to travel the building and make choices with the mouse. The key board is used to pause and exit the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940880/extras/1ca461f42fc991526cc8e3998f4cb329.poster.avif?t=1757978216\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940880/extras/1ca461f42fc991526cc8e3998f4cb329.webm?t=1757978216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940880/extras/1ca461f42fc991526cc8e3998f4cb329.mp4?t=1757978216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the human's sing about their problems! Your decisions along the way will change the songs you hear. There's a total of 17 unique songs in the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940880/extras/88317cad1d901f873d3dfed63c9de73f.poster.avif?t=1757978216\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap